    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Scum swarms</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–6</p><p>Swarm cats are the creation of scum gene-hackers. No two swarm cats tend to be alike—many of them are more like hyenas or mongooses—and each is likely to have a unique assortment of enhancements.The statistics given below should be used as a rough guidelines for other cats.</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Adrenal Boost, Basic Biomods, Claws, Cybercortex, Bioweave Armor (Light), Eelware, Enhanced Hearing, Enhanced Smell, Enhanced Vision, Mesh Inserts, Neurachem (Level 1), Prehensile Tail</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 6 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 6, Death Rating 45.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 162.</em></p>",
    "notes": ""
